
/* ================= j71 HỘI HÈ + LẬP CÔNG (owner 11/14): mini-events and contests on every festival day; merit events with real costs.
   Wraps only (endTurn, festToday, promoReqP untouched). Uses the j68 shared helpers (evChoice, evActor, evPickActor, evCooldown, evHistSeen/Mark, evBusy).
   FESTIVALS: on each festival day of the calendar (FEST, plus Thánh thọ Thái hậu), one mini-event from that festival's pool (≥12 variants, picked without
   repeating in this life and least-seen across the last five lives). Contests: every consort present is scored by the SAME formula (her stats, arts,
   servants) + the same luck; the odds word is the real chance computed from the real entrants; standings are logged truthfully; the winner (her or an NPC)
   takes the same prize. Wagers pay honestly (odds from the published form). Games with a rival move real silver between the two.
   MERIT: ~4 a year, 14 families (95 variants). Gains: Sủng, Danh, Thái hậu, Đức, backing of a court house (j55), Quốc sự bars (j55), a small Phúc duyên (j52,
   at most 3 a life), and 'xét công': the wait for the next sắc phong shortens by 1 month (lastPromo, same rule for NPCs, once per 6 months).
   NPC consorts earn merit too (monthly, same costs and gains). Big modals are skipped/deferred in a tuần where evBusy() is true. Festival modals are tagged {must:1} (fixed day), merit ones {opt:1} so the j68 scheduler spreads them. ================= */
